+    """Whether a parameter admits an extra write (#123, pure — pinned).
+
+    The write is an UNINTENDED side effect only on an argument the function leaves alone, and it
+    must be possible on every call the mutant will see:
+
+      calls_truncated  the observation stopped counting calls: "never mutated" was not established
+      mutated          the function writes to it: an added write is not unintended
+      type_varies      it was a mutable object in some calls and something else in others
+      unmutated        mutable and untouched in every observed call
